		<!-- Content -->
		<div class="container"><h1>Edit a Receipt</h1>
<p>Fix a mistake or update the details of a receipt you already saved.</p>

<h3>Steps</h3>
<ol>
	<li>In the <strong>Receipt List</strong>, click the receipt you want to change so it is highlighted.</li>
	<li>Click <strong>Edit</strong>. The <strong>Receipt Details</strong> window opens with that receipt's current values.</li>
</ol>
<img src="/images/edit-form.png" width="100%" alt="Edit form showing the Walmart receipt">

<ol start="3">
	<li>Change any field. In this example, the vendor is changed from Walmart to Kroger.</li>
</ol>
<img src="/images/edit-change.png" width="100%" alt="Vendor changed to Kroger">

<ol start="4">
	<li>Click <strong>Save</strong>. The list shows the updated receipt.</li>
</ol>
<img src="/images/edit-result.png" width="100%" alt="Receipt List showing Kroger">

<p>If you click <strong>Edit</strong> without selecting a receipt, the message "Select a receipt to edit." appears. Click <strong>Cancel</strong> to close the form without saving changes.</p>
<p>Next: <a href="/delete">delete a receipt</a>.</p>
		</div>

